WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:05.361
No framework: the web player, and our cat file in the public folder.

2
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:10.453
createAnimator puts the animation into any element.

3
00:00:21.033 --> 00:00:25.788
A slider jumps to any moment: progress, from zero to one.

4
00:00:45.867 --> 00:00:50.569
Or go straight to a time, in milliseconds, and play at any speed.

5
00:01:18.767 --> 00:01:24.514
Time, progress and speed: the same calls work in every Pixodesk player.
